# Angela, Bunnylove

> Angela is a support who trades her own body on the map for the right to upgrade one teammate at the exact moment a fight breaks open. She is not a generic healer. Pick her when your draft has a diver worth attaching to, and avoid her when the enemy can cancel her channel or isolate her before Heartguard lands.

